265
00:20:55,133 --> 00:20:57,667
And we were typing into source files.

266
00:20:58,200 --> 00:21:04,533
It was a long time ago,
and that propagates,

267
00:21:05,167 --> 00:21:09,400
and you get all sorts of strange results a
